# Gym Identity T1 (Canopy): greenhouse glass floor — leaf-light green under a mullion cross, dappled light with a rare Rainbow petal fleck. Canopy's own floor — split from Heritage's bloom family: glasshouse dapple over a drawn mullion, not open meadow.
